        <mxCell id="GdJAH7N0Vkg6060nRZas-37" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Grouping Inputs&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grouping inputs can be benificial in a case where there are multiple tables being accessed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here the Customer Input Field is In Group with the Agent input field.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In a technical point of view the the customer input should already contain the association to the productionTable defined by the user and get list of values by filtering unique entries in the customer name column&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and the Agent input field should be similar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But when the user selects the Customer name the data for agent should be automatically picked by&amp;nbsp; using query similar to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;select * customer_name , agent_name&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;from production_table&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;groupby agentname&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;where customer_name = {input field}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or through django models&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;class Production_table(models.Model) :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Customer_name = varchar()&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Agent_name = varchar()&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;....&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; object = production.objects.get(customer_name=&quot;variable&quot;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; object.Agentname&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-760" y="710" width="410" height="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LipfYxSrYUvN-pNy2O0Z-15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;required Views for Admin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;DB table Creator&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Form Creator&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;User management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#2D7600;fillColor=#60a917;fontColor=#080808;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="10" width="170" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
